---
id: infinite-query-property-order
title: Ensure correct order of inference sensitive properties for infinite queries
---
NIFT_TANSTACK_DOCUMENT_V1
{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For the following functions, the property order of the passed in object matters due to type inference:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useInfiniteQuery"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useSuspenseInfiniteQuery"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"infiniteQueryOptions"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The correct property order is as follows:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryFn"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getPreviousPageParam"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getNextPageParam"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All other properties are insensitive to the order as they do not depend on type inference."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"rule-details","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rule Details"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples of "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"incorrect"}]},{"type":"text","value":" code for this rule:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/infinite-query-property-order\": \"warn\" */\nimport { useInfiniteQuery } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nconst query = useInfiniteQuery({\n  queryKey: ['projects'],\n  getNextPageParam: (lastPage) => lastPage.nextId ?? undefined,\n  queryFn: async ({ pageParam }) => {\n    const response = await fetch(`/api/projects?cursor=${pageParam}`)\n    return await response.json()\n  },\n  initialPageParam: 0,\n  getPreviousPageParam: (firstPage) => firstPage.previousId ?? undefined,\n  maxPages: 3,\n})","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples of "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"correct"}]},{"type":"text","value":" code for this rule:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/infinite-query-property-order\": \"warn\" */\nimport { useInfiniteQuery } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nconst query = useInfiniteQuery({\n  queryKey: ['projects'],\n  queryFn: async ({ pageParam }) => {\n    const response = await fetch(`/api/projects?cursor=${pageParam}`)\n    return await response.json()\n  },\n  initialPageParam: 0,\n  getPreviousPageParam: (firstPage) => firstPage.previousId ?? undefined,\n  getNextPageParam: (lastPage) => lastPage.nextId ?? undefined,\n  maxPages: 3,\n})","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"attributes","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Attributes"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅ Recommended"}]}],"checked":true},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔧 Fixable"}]}],"checked":true}]}],"headings":[{"id":"rule-details","text":"Rule Details","level":2},{"id":"attributes","text":"Attributes","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nFor the following functions, the property order of the passed in object matters due to type inference:\n\n- `useInfiniteQuery`\n- `useSuspenseInfiniteQuery`\n- `infiniteQueryOptions`\n\nThe correct property order is as follows:\n\n- `queryFn`\n- `getPreviousPageParam`\n- `getNextPageParam`\n\nAll other properties are insensitive to the order as they do not depend on type inference.\n\n## Rule Details\n\nExamples of **incorrect** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\n/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/infinite-query-property-order\": \"warn\" */\nimport { useInfiniteQuery } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nconst query = useInfiniteQuery({\n  queryKey: ['projects'],\n  getNextPageParam: (lastPage) => lastPage.nextId ?? undefined,\n  queryFn: async ({ pageParam }) => {\n    const response = await fetch(`/api/projects?cursor=${pageParam}`)\n    return await response.json()\n  },\n  initialPageParam: 0,\n  getPreviousPageParam: (firstPage) => firstPage.previousId ?? undefined,\n  maxPages: 3,\n})\n```\n\nExamples of **correct** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\n/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/infinite-query-property-order\": \"warn\" */\nimport { useInfiniteQuery } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nconst query = useInfiniteQuery({\n  queryKey: ['projects'],\n  queryFn: async ({ pageParam }) => {\n    const response = await fetch(`/api/projects?cursor=${pageParam}`)\n    return await response.json()\n  },\n  initialPageParam: 0,\n  getPreviousPageParam: (firstPage) => firstPage.previousId ?? undefined,\n  getNextPageParam: (lastPage) => lastPage.nextId ?? undefined,\n  maxPages: 3,\n})\n```\n\n## Attributes\n\n- [x] ✅ Recommended\n- [x] 🔧 Fixable\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: infinite-query-property-order\ntitle: Ensure correct order of inference sensitive properties for infinite queries\n---\n\nFor the following functions, the property order of the passed in object matters due to type inference:\n\n- `useInfiniteQuery`\n- `useSuspenseInfiniteQuery`\n- `infiniteQueryOptions`\n\nThe correct property order is as follows:\n\n- `queryFn`\n- `getPreviousPageParam`\n- `getNextPageParam`\n\nAll other properties are insensitive to the order as they do not depend on type inference.\n\n## Rule Details\n\nExamples of **incorrect** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\n/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/infinite-query-property-order\": \"warn\" */\nimport { useInfiniteQuery } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nconst query = useInfiniteQuery({\n  queryKey: ['projects'],\n  getNextPageParam: (lastPage) => lastPage.nextId ?? undefined,\n  queryFn: async ({ pageParam }) => {\n    const response = await fetch(`/api/projects?cursor=${pageParam}`)\n    return await response.json()\n  },\n  initialPageParam: 0,\n  getPreviousPageParam: (firstPage) => firstPage.previousId ?? undefined,\n  maxPages: 3,\n})\n```\n\nExamples of **correct** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\n/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/infinite-query-property-order\": \"warn\" */\nimport { useInfiniteQuery } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nconst query = useInfiniteQuery({\n  queryKey: ['projects'],\n  queryFn: async ({ pageParam }) => {\n    const response = await fetch(`/api/projects?cursor=${pageParam}`)\n    return await response.json()\n  },\n  initialPageParam: 0,\n  getPreviousPageParam: (firstPage) => firstPage.previousId ?? undefined,\n  getNextPageParam: (lastPage) => lastPage.nextId ?? undefined,\n  maxPages: 3,\n})\n```\n\n## Attributes\n\n- [x] ✅ Recommended\n- [x] 🔧 Fixable\n"}
